          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "17. (1) 计算: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( x + 1 ) ( x - 1 ) + x ( 2 - x ) ."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (2) 解不等式组: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} 4x - 3 > 9 \\\\ 2 + x \\geqslant 0 \\end{array} \\right."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.045,
            0.643,
            0.454,
            0.704
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "[答案]:【小问 1 详解】解: 原式 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "=x^{2}-1+2x-x^{2}=2x-1;"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 【小问 2 详解】解: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} 4x - 3 > 9(1) \\\\ 2 + x \\geqslant 0(2) \\end{array} \\right."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , 解不等式 (1), 得 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x > 3 ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 解不等式 (2), 得 𝑥 ⩾ −2, 所以原不等式组的解是 𝑥 > 3. [解析]:"
            }
